{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"issues\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"screen\": \"舞步变得灵活流动，从前半段的焦躁转入后半段的柔和\",\n      \"source\": \"一种听法把前半段（66–79小节）听成焦躁、急切，后半段（80–91小节）则忽然柔和、亲切，带一点近乎田园的轻盈。\",\n      \"type\": \"2\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿明确限定为一种听法，屏幕旁注却把这种主观听法写成了确定的音乐情绪变化。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"screen\": \"先前带波兰舞曲气息的声音重现，却已不再完整鲜明\",\n      \"source\": \"也可以听成先前那些更有宣告意味、带着波兰舞曲气息的声音再次出现；只是它已不再像最初那样，以完整而鲜明的姿态建立秩序。\",\n      \"type\": \"2\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿将其作为一种可选的听法，屏幕旁注删掉这一限定，变成了确定的音乐描述。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"screen\": \"先前的摇篮曲在F小调上破碎重现，听来凄厉哀婉\",\n      \"source\": \"另一种更凄厉哀婉的听法，是听见先前那段摇篮曲破碎地重现，只是这次变成了F小调。\",\n      \"type\": \"2\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿明确说这只是另一种听法，屏幕旁注却将摇篮曲主题的重现直接写成确定事实。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b588604e-8eab-499f-b13f-c9b5deac5157", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T051518733920Z", "elapsed_seconds": 442.469, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T05:22:41.212658+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "96b7a533c59a00cec2afd81665a6993cc50d531859a49958d0117de95af473f5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_c